<title>UK: Allgemeine Hypo prices 500 mln mark bond increase.</title>
<headline>Allgemeine Hypo prices 500 mln mark bond increase.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond increase has been priced joint lead managers BZW, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and Westdeutsche Landesbank said on wednesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    01.FEB.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.805    PAY DATE  S-07.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    98.62     SPREAD	+7 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    DENOMS (K) ONE	 HOME CTRY  GERMANY</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.14	SELL CONC  0.185</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT JAN 2006 BUND  NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 483</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
